  "name": "two-pair-stp-off-baseline",
  "lab": "Medium lab",
  "title": "Baseline \u00b7 two MLAG pairs, spanning tree off",
  "action": "Resets the data bridge on all four CHRs over management SSH with protocol-mode=none. Pair A (CHR 1 MLAG primary, CHR 2 MLAG secondary) and pair B (CHR 3 MLAG primary, CHR 4 MLAG secondary) are joined by one distributed LACP bond, mlag-id 11 on pair A and 21 on pair B. Host 1 bonds to pair B and host 2 to pair A, so both VLAN 110 streams cross both pairs. Then runs numbered 100 ms pings for 4 s in both VLAN 110 and both bypass directions and reads back bridge, MLAG and LACP state on all four CHRs. No fault is applied.",
